{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01235",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.2,
      "end_seconds": 5.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Doctor? Hello, I hope this is the right time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.46,
      "end_seconds": 10.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.63,
      "end_seconds": 19.16,
      "duration_seconds": 7.53,
      "text": "Ah, it's a tight band around my head. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.98,
      "end_seconds": 22.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.91,
      "end_seconds": 25.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Probably three weeks. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.19,
      "end_seconds": 31.43,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.26,
      "end_seconds": 42.03,
      "duration_seconds": 9.77,
      "text": "I'd say a few times a day. It's severe, honestly. I've had a stiff neck too, for three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.27,
      "end_seconds": 45.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "How often do you get it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.61,
      "end_seconds": 51.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "It's all the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.8,
      "end_seconds": 57.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "What about tired eyes, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.07,
      "end_seconds": 64.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Yes, um, actually."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.29,
      "end_seconds": 73.69,
      "duration_seconds": 8.4,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.85,
      "end_seconds": 79.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "It settles a little with breaks. It's worse with screens."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.77,
      "end_seconds": 80.73,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "Right, right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.2,
      "end_seconds": 99.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.72,
      "end_seconds": 102.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "No, I've always been fairly healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.38,
      "end_seconds": 106.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.32,
      "end_seconds": 114.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.37,
      "end_seconds": 118.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.36,
      "end_seconds": 121.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.33,
      "end_seconds": 126.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.76,
      "end_seconds": 131.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.07,
      "end_seconds": 138.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.2,
      "end_seconds": 141.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.94,
      "end_seconds": 146.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.35,
      "end_seconds": 152.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "Just a mole taken off my arm, a few years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.9,
      "end_seconds": 156.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.48,
      "end_seconds": 162.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Paracetamol, 1 gram, maybe, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.82,
      "end_seconds": 167.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.99,
      "end_seconds": 171.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "No, it's at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.24,
      "end_seconds": 177.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Any weakness, sickness, sensitivity to light or blurred vision?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.93,
      "end_seconds": 181.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.03,
      "end_seconds": 185.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.37,
      "end_seconds": 191.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.54,
      "end_seconds": 194.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.21,
      "end_seconds": 198.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "No, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.62,
      "end_seconds": 211.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.44,
      "end_seconds": 225.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.7,
      "end_seconds": 254.86,
      "duration_seconds": 9.16,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 112 over 73, temperature 36.9, respiratory rate 18, SpO2 99 percent on room air, heart rate 76."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.56,
      "end_seconds": 261.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.7,
      "end_seconds": 265.65,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.47,
      "end_seconds": 268.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.0,
      "end_seconds": 284.31,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "Your neck and shoulder muscles are tight, and your eye movements are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.57,
      "end_seconds": 290.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "You can sit up now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.34,
      "end_seconds": 330.67,
      "duration_seconds": 31.33,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, I think we're dealing with tension-type headache at this stage. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I'll request an eye test, it'll help with eye strain. Take screen breaks every hour and try regular neck stretches. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.49,
      "end_seconds": 340.49,
      "duration_seconds": 9.0,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.27,
      "end_seconds": 342.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.92,
      "end_seconds": 352.43,
      "duration_seconds": 8.51,
      "text": "Do get help quickly if the headache becomes sudden and severe. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.95,
      "end_seconds": 356.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 357.93,
      "end_seconds": 359.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}